window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>In the otherworld realm of Parknival Wonderland begins the story of a boy who loves a girl.</p> <p>Meet Grey, a former baker turned magical park manager, and Billie, a curious and innocent dungeon spirit who dreams of being human. Together, they embark on a journey of creation, wonder, and unexpected romance.</p> <p>As they conjure life-sized chess battles, roller coasters through the stars, and enchanted attractions, the bond between them grows closer amidst the backdrop of a park where dreams and reality blur.</p> <p>Join them as they navigate human emotions and the magic of a world where anything is possible, in a tale of whimsical danger and the transformative power of the connection between two people.</p>"; 
